1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,514
The need is large.

2
00:00:01,514 --> 00:00:08,728
Alternative assets are heading to thirty-two trillion dollars by 2030, and venture investors put in four hundred and twenty-five billion last year.

3
00:00:08,728 --> 00:00:14,645
Yet in 2024, private equity paid back just eleven percent of its value, a ten-year low.

